    "name": "luh-cosense3d",
    "notes": "This Repo provides all datasets or their external links for the project CoSense3D.\r\nThe related datasets are:\r\n\r\n-  [__COMAP__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/COMAP/): A synthetic data generated by CARLA for cooperative perception.\r\n\r\n-  [__OPV2Vt__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/OPV2Vt/): A synthetic data generated by CARLA with the replay files provided by the dataset [OPV2V](https://mobility-lab.seas.ucla.edu/opv2v/) for the purpose of globally time-aligned cooperative object detection (TA-COOD). The original replay files are interpolated to obtain the object and sensor locations at sub-frames. Each frame is spitted into 10 sub-frames for simulation.\r\n\r\n\r\n-  [__DairV2Xt__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/DairV2Xt/): New generate meta files based on dataset [DAIR-V2X](https://thudair.baai.ac.cn/index) for the project CoSense3D with localization correction and ground truth generate for TA-COOD.\r\n\r\n-  [__OPV2Va__](https://data.uni-hannover.de/vault/ikg/yuan/cosense3d/OPV2Va/): A synthetic data generated by CARLA with the replay files provided by the dataset [OPV2V](https://mobility-lab.seas.ucla.edu/opv2v/) augmented with semantic labels.\r\n\r\n> [__!NOTE__]\r\n> If you find the downloading speed is very slow, you can also try the Baidu Cloud: \u94fe\u63a5: https://pan.baidu.com/s/12HZ1yk0y84NJfStZADMstA?pwd=hkja \u63d0\u53d6\u7801: hkja \r\n--\u6765\u81ea\u767e\u5ea6\u7f51\u76d8\u8d85\u7ea7\u4f1a\u5458v1\u7684\u5206\u4eab",
